["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Walt Disney Company Flywheel Multiplane camera Cel animation Pencil test Seven Powers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-22-acquired-迪士尼飞轮-艺术-商业与工程的百年复利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372eb871b3602a8b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:31:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>迪士尼護城河不是IP，是Walt的飛輪設計</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼的護城河不是IP本身，而是Walt將藝術與商業在腦中結合後，用工程手段打造的飛輪：高質量動畫、最大化發行、注入輔助節點，再以數十年複利滾動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IP運營</span><span class=\"tag\">飛輪效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 10: Burnout vs Depression: The Mental Load of Mothers Burnout DSM Medicalization Benzodiazepines\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-15-parentmojo-妈妈不是病了-是社会病了-抑郁诊断如何转移问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">18:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0615</span></div>\n<h2>媽媽不是病了，是社會病了：抑鬱診斷如何轉移問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Burnout 被誤診為抑鬱，問題被歸因於個體大腦而非社會環境。新西蘭研究發現，每天有人幫做家務六個月的產婦幾乎不產後抑鬱，但藥物仍是首選方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抑鬱診斷</span><span class=\"tag\">母親 burnout</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"145. 口述SpaceX開發史：和前高管洪力德聊，馬斯克用人觀、最大IPO、太空與AI、人類文明擴張前奏？ reusable rocket SKU first principles Class Plus Elon Mafia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-12-zhangxiaojun-spacex-前高管-火箭不是目的-马斯克要的是整个太空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/055133beb1772443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>SpaceX 前高管：火箭不是目的，馬斯克要的是整個太空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SpaceX 從不把自己當火箭公司，火箭只是手段。飛鷹一號成功後立刻退役，飛鷹九號把每公斤發射成本從兩萬美元壓到三千美元，星艦目標一百美元以下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業航天</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"發券、裂變、極速版，如何用紅包設計增長？丨字節跳動 第8集 K因子 (K-factor) RY1/RY2/RY3 紅包中臺\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-12-luanfanshu-极速版的本质不是增长-是商业化和算法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42a856e6750ff434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">2:59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>極速版紅包不是增長，是算法和商業化的收割機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人口紅利消失後，紅包、極速版、發券這套玩法的核心不是增長，而是用商業化和算法承接流量；AI時代買量接近失靈，增長回到模型能力與心智營銷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">用戶增長</span><span class=\"tag\">極速版</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 196: Dominic D’Agostino discusses advances in ketogenic metabolic therapy and hyperbaric oxygen therapy ketone metabolic therapy hyperbaric oxygen therapy Glasgow Coma Scale 1,3-butanediol glucose hypometabolism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-11-stemtalk-脑外伤本质是能量危机-酮体能绕过受损的葡萄糖代谢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7070f878b7e6606f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0611</span></div>\n<h2>腦外傷本質是能量危機，酮體能繞過受損的葡萄糖代謝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創傷性腦損傷後大腦先超量用糖、再長期糖代謝低下，而酮體不依賴這條受損通路，還能抑制神經炎症——這解釋了為什麼酮代謝療法能同時作用於癲癇、精神障礙和成癮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腦外傷</span><span class=\"tag\">酮體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"144. 對陽萌的4小時訪談：消費電子死與生、第三類公司、端側模型、產品方法、遊戲模式 存算一體 馮諾依曼架構 N-time efficiency worker SackKit 康威定律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-08-zhangxiaojun-安克做芯片-从五系到七系-一家消费电子公司的补课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99b672a2ad0c5ace-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>安克做芯片：從五系到七系，一家消費電子公司的補課</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安克前11年順風順水，2022年卻發現自己建的產品線打不過外面的獨角獸。陽萌的解法不是換人，而是把公司從五系產品公司改造成七系創新公司——代價是補上第一性、求極致、共成長這套價值觀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費電子</span><span class=\"tag\">存算一體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing Entropy | Compression is Intelligence Part 1 prefix-free code noiseless coding theorem entropy rate cross-entropy loss\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-07-karpathy-压缩就是智能-预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/911ed142cc051a24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0607</span></div>\n<h2>壓縮就是智能：預測與壓縮是同一枚硬幣的兩面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">信息論說預測和壓縮在數學上等價，所以語言模型的預訓練目標可以重新理解為造一臺最高效的文本壓縮器，而不只是預測下一個 token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息論</span><span class=\"tag\">壓縮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"266: If ADHD Medication Doesn’t Help Kids Learn, What Does? MTA study crossover design DSM misrecognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-parentmojo-adhd-药物改得了行为-改不了学习/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">30:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD 藥物改得了行為，改不了學習</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley 把 ADHD 比作糖尿病，但 64% 的人會反覆移出診斷標準；藥物提高服從性卻不改善學習，MTA 長期隨訪證實無學業優勢，真正有效的是小班差異化教學。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"143. 對何小鵬的第二次訪談：更大賭注、人形機器人Iron誕生、那場意外、技術劇變下CEO、GX和縫合怪 VLA 縫合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：通用人形機器人99.99%會死，我們賭那兩成勝率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬把花了小几十億的自動駕駛體系整個停掉，因為用軟件方法論加AI工具箱做出來的只是「AI縫合怪」。他給通用人形機器人的勝率是兩成，而機器人創業難度是造車的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的創投觀察第2集：Harness、下一個字節、2026大機會和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系統，模型只是插拔的處理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，真正值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司。用戶對 Harness 更忠誠——他會換模型，但不想換掉存著自己記憶的那個殼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投資札記第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把電機塞進蒸汽機、接力賽變籃球賽、孤獨、人的連接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的對話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當 90% 到 95% 的信息性內容都能直接問 AI 拿到，以信息交換為目的的對話正在被掏空，人和人之間剩下的只有情感連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"140. 對姚順宇的4小時訪談：請允許我小瘋一下！在Anthropic和Gemini訓模型、技術預測、英雄主義已過去 scaling law reward signal multi-agent VLA context management continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-是浪-冲浪的人不重要-模型大厂研究员的自白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dddeb887e7c6825c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0511</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是浪，衝浪的人不重要：模型大廠研究員的自白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">預訓練沒有到頭，撞牆的人多半是自己有 bug；AI 本質是簡單的，因為它能做實驗。個人英雄主義時代已經過去，現在拼的是組織系統性和靠譜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"139. 【Agent的綜述】和蘇煜聊Agent技術史、OpenClaw Moment、邊界的消弭和社會的輻射 semantic parsing language agent world model continual learning cortical column non-parametric learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-01-zhangxiaojun-agent-的瓶颈不是智能-是它学不会成为专家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ac45bf92bdd9de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:17:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的瓶頸不是智能，是它學不會成為專家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用智能已經夠用且廉價，真正稀缺的是 specialized intelligence——讓 agent 像實習生變成老師傅那樣，持續學會某個小世界的 world model。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"138. 對羅福莉3.5小時訪談：AI範式已然鉅變！OpenClaw、Agent範式很吃後訓練、卡的分配、組織平權 OpenClaw MTP MLA Hybrid-Tension Non-Colice Skills\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-24-zhangxiaojun-openclaw-让罗福莉改判-agent-框架能补齐模型短板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c4c5c5e555fef3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0424</span></div>\n<h2>OpenClaw 讓羅福莉改判：Agent 框架能補齊模型短板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她最初覺得它只是個偏運營的殼，春節深夜裝上後，它兩天內接手了她的生活與研究；她由此判斷：一套複雜的 agent 編排，能把中級模型的短板補到接近頂尖水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"137. 對洪樂潼的4小時訪談：AI for Math、把數學變成Lean、數學天書中的證明、直覺、被創造與被發現的 ATP ITP Lean auto formalization groupthink\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-20-zhangxiaojun-ai-用几千行-lean-代码硬解普特南题-这不是智能的胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d6c7e8a9f3635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0420</span></div>\n<h2>AI 用幾千行 Lean 代碼硬解普特南題，這不是智能的勝利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普特南競賽 98 年只有五個滿分，AI 拿到第六個，但它沒走人類那張圖，而是用幾千行 Lean 代碼枚舉硬算——自動定理證明這個領域在 AI 之前就存在了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Math</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季報第9集：和廣密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成為新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：沒有領先的 Coding 模型就像沒有領先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水嶺不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能組織幾百個最聰明的人 all in 做數據這件髒活——Anthropic 贏在戰略專注，OpenAI 輸在什麼都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年產1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特：賣的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年產僅1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特。秘訣在於同時擁有奢侈品的排他性和運動隊的包容性，用稀缺性製造神話，用社群維持忠誠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然選擇創始人Tristan聊，Elys、賽博分身、靈魂、Context的獲取與流動和AI社交網絡 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI時代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交網絡要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 認為 AI 時代唯一重要的事是構建主體性——把 context 沉澱下來，讓 AI 替你做社交裡最無聊的商增，人只接管最重要的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"134. 【數據的綜述】和謝晨聊，新時代的石油、歷史、版圖、數據金字塔、定價與Recipe Sim-to-Real Shadow Mode Data Engine Behavior VLA Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-30-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉那套数据闭环-在机器人身上走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d3e6746f1dd5fb6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉那套數據閉環，在機器人身上走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉能收到最多數據，是因為它部署了最多自己的車，靠的是本體。但具身領域沒有上百萬臺機器人，最多的數據必然來自仿真和人的第一視角，本體商當不成最好的大腦商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"133. 對謝賽寧的7小時馬拉松訪談：世界模型、逃出硅谷、AMI Labs、兩次拒絕Ilya、楊立昆、李飛飛和42 research taste representation learning contrastive learning anti-fragile DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-16-zhangxiaojun-世界模型不是语言模型-谢赛宁说lm终将凋零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4818fadeef8d1188-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">6:45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是語言模型：謝賽寧說LM終將凋零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">謝賽寧認為語言模型是很好的工具，但不是通用智能的地基——它終將凋零。真正的地基是視覺與表徵學習，這也是他離開硅谷、和楊立昆創立AMI的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">表徵學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代碼比交人更可能合作，但協調極難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡讓雙方互讀源代碼，用 Löb 定理實現合作；但合作依賴幾乎相同的代碼或共享隨機數，現實中協調成本極高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 產權，是為了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 擁有產權，它們就更不願意破壞產權制度本身——包括搶走人類全部財產。這不是道德關懷，是風險對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"132. 對星海圖創始人高繼揚的3小時訪談：鯰魚、曾國藩、Waymo與Momenta的兩面、一隻狼與許華哲的離開 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>機器人行業不浪漫：鏈條太長，人得把頭伸到土裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海圖創始人高繼揚說，機器人創業的競爭是六邊形：整機、供應鏈、數據、模型、渠道、終端，算法傳播週期只有兩三個月，壁壘最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任階躍星辰董事長的訪談：聰明人的誘惑、取捨、超長鏈路殘酷淘汰賽、階躍函數和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任階躍星辰董事長：基模公司做2B和純2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少燒30億人民幣、要維持三到五年，所以做2B或純C端軟件都算不過賬；階躍的賭注是基模加終端，用軟硬一體換一張上牌桌的資格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>"]